WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.180 line:-2 size:50%
Typing up quotes in the evening? Nope.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:07.050 line:-2 size:50%
I hold a key, talk, and the text is in the email.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.750 line:-2 size:50%
These days I tell my chapters out loud.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.300 line:-2 size:50%
inlaut writes along, and none of it leaves my Mac.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.760 line:-2 size:50%
Ticket, commit, Slack.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:21.950 line:-2 size:50%
I just speak, and the recognition runs entirely on my Mac.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.350 line:-2 size:50%
Out here the connection is often gone.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.700 line:-2 size:50%
inlaut still works, with no internet at all.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.690 line:-2 size:50%
I simply dictate my report card comments.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:34.300 line:-2 size:50%
Saying “new paragraph” keeps it all neatly structured.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.640 line:-2 size:50%
After a session, I dictate my notes.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:41.250 line:-2 size:50%
The recordings are neither stored nor sent anywhere.
